# 构建 docker 镜像时不需要的东西（也防止私有数据和配置进镜像）
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
!backend/.env.example
backend/data
backend/data_test
backend/backup_test
backend/tests
frontend/dist
frontend/test-results
frontend/playwright-report
release
deploy/windows/bin
.git
.github
.vscode
*.log
